Well this one was so disappointing, a chef's recipe for Turkish Dondurma or Turkish stretchy ice cream and it is one of the worst ice creams i've made. 
I didn't adjust this recipe at all, I didn't put it in to an ice cream calculator either so it shows what to expect when selecting a random recipe from the internet. 
Please don't waste your time making this, it is just a waste of money and ingredients. 
I am though, going to make this a 3 part series so I can actually finish with a decent recipe for Turkish ice cream without using Salep (the real salep, orchid root flour) or Mastic. 

Until next time ✌️
Nick

